    "text": "\u00d0is sind \u00f0a landgem\u00e6ra \u00f0ara twegra hida \u00f0e hyra\u00f0 to Osanlea.\nEast on \u00f0a lanan, and \u00f0onne andlang slades on \u00f0one blacan pyt.\nOf \u00f0ane pytte on \u00f0one lampyt.\nAndlang mearce.\nOf \u00f0an pytte ut on byrcan sl\u00e6d.\nOf byrcan slade on \u00f0a ealdan dic.\nOf \u00f0\u00e6re ealdan dic on henna ri\u00f0e.\nOf henna ri\u00f0e up andlang sl\u00e6des to ipan lea.\nOf ipan lea on bromh\u00e6g andlang weges on \u00f0a lanan, and \u00f0ara twegra hyda wuda innan gem\u00e6nnesse.",
